msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr "Uf... Uf..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "84_Akiyama"
msgid "You're going to give me all that money back. Got it?"
msgstr "Vas a devolverme cada centavo. ¿Entendido?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Nishihama"
msgid "Yes, sir... Please, take it. I'm just happy to have made\\r\nmy dreams come true."
msgstr "Sí, señor... Tómelo, por favor. Lo importante es que he\\r\nlogrado mis sueños."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Akiyama"
msgid "Of all the stupid ways to use money...! This really takes\\r\nthe cake."
msgstr "De todas las formas absurdas de gastar dinero... ¡Esta se\\r\nlleva el premio!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Nishihama"
msgid "It's not as bad as all that. Say! How about a quick soak\\r\nbefore you go?"
msgstr "No es tan malo como cree. ¿Por qué no lo prueba antes de\\r\nque se vaya?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "144_Akiyama"
msgid "You've got to be kidding me!"
msgstr "¡No estoy para tus juegos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Nishihama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "156_Nishihama"
msgid "Then, how about a souvenir? You did come all this way."
msgstr "Considerando que ha venido hasta aquí, ¿por qué no llevarse un recuerdo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_Akiyama"
msgid "I can't even be mad anymore... Look, I'll send someone to\\r\nretrieve the money. Until then, just do whatever you want."
msgstr "No vale la pena enojarme por esto... Enviaré a alguien para\\r\nrecoger el dinero. Mientras tanto, haz lo que se te antoje."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Nishihama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "228_Nishihama"
msgid "Okay, everybody, you know what that means! Back in the tub!"
msgstr "¡Venga, gente! ¡Es hora de regresar a la bañera!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Miki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=12
msgctxt "240_Miki"
msgid "Hooray! Dad, you're the greatest!"
msgstr "¡Hurra! ¡Papá, eres el mejor!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "288_Akiyama"
msgid "Is this some kind of joke?"
msgstr "¿Me están tomando el pelo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Nishihama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "312_Nishihama"
msgid "Hey, honey! Akiyama caught up with us!"
msgstr "¡Cariño! ¡Akiyama nos encontró!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "324_Akiyama"
msgid "What in the world...?"
msgstr "¿Qué carajo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Nishihama's Wife
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=15
msgctxt "336_Nishihama's Wife"
msgid "Eeeeek! Trying to sneak a peek, you perv!?"
msgstr "¡Kyaa! ¡¿Cómo te atreves a espiarme, cerdo?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_Nishihama"
msgid "Akiyama! You've got a lot of nerve, barging in on my wife\\r\nwhile she's bathing!"
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san! ¡Cómo se atreve a irrumpir mientras mi\\r\nesposa se baña!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "360_Akiyama"
msgid "<Italic>I've</Italic> got a lot of nerve!? What the hell are you doing with\\r\nmy money?"
msgstr "¡¿Cómo <Italic>me</Italic> atrevo?! ¿Y tú quién te crees para preguntar\\r\nalgo así? ¡¿Qué demonios haces con mi dinero?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Akiyama"
msgid "You swindle it out of me, and this is what you decide to do\\r\nwith it!?"
msgstr "¡¿Me engañaste y esto es lo que haces con mi dinero?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Nishihama"
msgid "Oh, come on! I've wanted to wallow in a bathtub full of cash\\r\nsince I was a kid! You see it in movies and stuff all the\\r\ntime!"
msgstr "Por favor, ¡he deseado poder bañarme en una bañera llena de\\r\ndinero desde que era niño! ¡Es algo que se ve a menudo en\\r\nlas películas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Nishihama's Wife"
msgid "That's right! You could probably count on one hand the\\r\nnumber of people who've had this opportunity!"
msgstr "¡Muy cierto! Puedo hasta contar con una sola mano el número\\r\nde personas que han tenido una oportunidad como esta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Akiyama"
msgid "You needed money so badly that you felt you had to scam me\\r\nfor it... I thought you were in trouble."
msgstr "Necesitabas con tanta desesperación el dinero que consideraste\\r\nnecesario estafarme... Pensé que estabas en problemas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Akiyama"
msgid "I lend money to people who've hit rock bottom so I can watch\\r\nthem turn their lives around."
msgstr "Presto dinero a personas que han tocado fondo para poder\\r\nobservar cómo cambian sus vidas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "432_Akiyama"
msgid "And here you are, using my money for this bullshit!"
msgstr "Y aquí te veo, ¡usando mi dinero para estas mierdas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Nishihama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "444_Nishihama"
msgid "Our dream isn't bullshit!"
msgstr "¡Este sueño no es una mierda!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Nishihama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "456_Nishihama"
msgid "In fact, I'd say it's even worth killing for!"
msgstr "De hecho, ¡diría que vale la pena matar por ello!"
